Bind Npc 31550 Zone 1
Quest 622 "Subjugation of the Goblin Village I"
    Journal "You must perform mission with [Goblin Subjugation Squad] Raul."
    Kill 20 of 2951, 2901

Requires player level >= 60 and player is karus and quest 621 is completed

Rewards
    Give 12500000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "Master, let's help [Goblin Subjugation Squad] and start fighting Goblins!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "You are here, <selfname>. The number of Kobold inhabiting in Goblin villages has been growing exponentially."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "It is clear that if Kobold continues to expand, they will take over this entire land to make it their habitat if we do nothing.  Would you help me?\n\nNear the village of Goblin Karus area [the Raul Goblin Squad] and must fight against Kobold."

On in_progress
    Say "There are just too many of them. Let's do a little better this time."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have done well/Goob job."
